Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.61,0:01:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're awesome, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bass!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we're friends with\Nthe outlaw to save the city, Clay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.93,0:01:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, he's a dangerous\Ncriminal, ain't he, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Trico!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, so are you enjoying your drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Bash the Stampede really\Nis an unusual guy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, everybody's a lot less\Ntense now that the plant is fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.37,0:02:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But those are the very same people\Nthat tried to kill him for the reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.07,0:02:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he might be more\Nuncomfortable around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.41,0:02:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trouble seems to follow\Nhim wherever he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the world would be a lot\Nbetter and safer place without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I can't handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am unique and eat anything I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have a separate stomach\Njust for cake and ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend is another unusual one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.33,0:02:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's completely out of\Nit, dead to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I gave him a\Nlittle too much to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I called you\Nboth out here for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think he'd pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.03,0:03:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure to say hi to Sylvie for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really too bad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get a chance to sleep\Nwith a guy like that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, see you around. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I be regretting it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.89,0:03:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash is leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he didn't even say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Millie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.49,0:03:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just told me. that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash got on the sand steamer.\NBut we don't have enough money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash wait
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you better come\Nback and see me sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you just leave\Nwithout saying goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be good to your mom and\Nstay out of trouble, Taunus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.95,0:04:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last I am finally on my own again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I drank too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.97,0:05:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure don't look like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't call anyone for room service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.83,0:05:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to go into Latenburg Canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.59,0:05:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.07,0:05:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have heard of it, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the turf of the biggest,\Nbaddest, most notorious gang around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bad lad thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can get you on guard duty,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can charge double the fare, and\Nwe'll both make some good money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say you'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a simple passenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life, my safety is depending\Non your ship's defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure wish I had chosen\Na quieter way to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to catch some more Z's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.43,0:05:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know when you hurt somebody\Nthat you're supposed to apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this! I'm bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.53,0:06:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that when you're bashed\Nthrough the vent, you big idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this supposed to be,\Nsome kind of stranglehold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hurt me while\Nyou're up in the air, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a stowaway, aren't you? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My parents died when I was real young,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I went to live with\Nsome distant relatives,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.11,0:06:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was so horrible\Nthere I couldn't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandmother would get\Ndrunk and hit me all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my weird uncle was really mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was always trying to get at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just get to me, I can escape\Nthem if I have to go back to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.71,0:06:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what they'll do to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't don't turn me in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:07:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I'm dead nobody's dumb\Nenough to buy such a lame story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the worst one I've ever come up with
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand it must\Nhave been so hard don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worry, I'll protect you.\NWhoa! Is this guy for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's two bacon lettuce\Ndogs two cartons of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,milk wait a minute four\Nbags of pretzels and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one pack of raisins I\Nmust say I am very curious
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as to why you insurance\Ngirls are here doing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this work care to let me in on it well we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't have enough money\Nfor a ticket so we got a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,part-time job here all\Ntogether that It comes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.59,0:07:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To twelve dollars and seventy-five cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed that you're still so hungry\Nafter just having finished your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have an appetite\Njust like a growing boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.15,0:07:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, those girls are pretty sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big one is exceptionally scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only salvation is she\Ndoesn't know how smart she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.63,0:08:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guard this place well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.57,0:08:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy to get\Nyou that room, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, growing boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mouth may be silent,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your eyes speak real loud\Nand clear saying I'm starving
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really dark out there,\Nnot a single light to be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be bright soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that Mr. Goody Goody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more left. I gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bear me. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's our time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, two, five, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kids should have it all set by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven minutes to parade time,\Nmake it good and flashy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right on time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the purple signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Badwick King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:10:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big man doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was getting\Npaid, so this doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't the main cannons firing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.93,0:11:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.09,0:11:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on the starboard rear hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the magnificent dreadnought raiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, leader of the bad lads,\Npersonally trained them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brilliant dynamite's neon now emerges.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.41,0:12:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.63,0:12:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, my friends, it's harvest time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What glitters on this ship belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You performed brilliantly, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now gather all the passengers in one spot\Nand take me to the party room. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.53,0:12:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The second evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the children love them, have\Nall joined hands and composed a waltz.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.95,0:13:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The meaning of life?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a very serious\Nmind, aren't you, Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We decide our own destinies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our tickets to the future are open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, decide your own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave yet! Rem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WAIT!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic beggars?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.17,0:14:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open it up for me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.71,0:14:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do it even if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.63,0:14:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't a single person on this ship\Nwho knows a combination to that safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.83,0:14:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, the only coded key is\Ncarefully locked away in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear it's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.45,0:14:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means we'll just\Nhave to break it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we have made our way around the\Nmountain to the right, then go straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In five, take a northeast course\Nand stay within sight of the canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then begin to accelerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At full speed, we will arrive\Nin just about ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:15:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our destination the\NAnora precipice what well at
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,least let me release the\Npassengers please sir we risked
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our lives to get here it's\Nonly fair that you should
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be expected to risk your\Nlives too depraved mad lunatic
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Super Express will take\Nyour lives out in a blaze
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.93,0:15:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of glory if it's not flashy\Nin high style what's the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,point this is a horrible\Nmess we're in Meryl we're
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna need a lot more than\Njust the two of us to take on
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a gang that's so heavily armed\Nthe only person who could
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do something in a situation\Nlike this is him although
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it I can't\Neven believe I just said
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that my neck hurts I have\Nabsolutely no idea where I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.21,0:16:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neil boy, isn't that the break?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.43,0:16:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you actually think I wouldn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone on this crew is sworn to\Nprotect the passengers at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't good conscience go against that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll honor that even if I have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.01,0:16:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.31,0:16:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the stuff pros are made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll preserve you just like\Nyou are while you're still beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.27,0:16:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.41,0:16:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got the kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now now don't look so\Ngrim, little partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.03,0:16:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adults are prone to many\Nunhappy differences of opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought you up here\Nbecause I wanted to see
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you knew how to\Nsteer this huge clunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know the layout of the console,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you need to regulate\Nthe amount of co2 sent to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the heating plant and monitor\Nthe stress on the boiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.81,0:17:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light and heat on the hydro plant also
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.57,0:17:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,needs to be regulated\Nand monitored constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important to have experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.75,0:17:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.31,0:17:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is this\Nthing is a pain in the ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I shouldn't have\Nkilled the poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's so important\Nabout the steering?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's been\Nexhilarating, kind of funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.35,0:17:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you just take\Nthe goods and split now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, because the plan has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swag of the day is in the huge\Nsafe in the middle of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot tougher than the usual\Ncrappy safes we run into.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The worst part of it is that we have\Nmilky unless we go into the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.65,0:17:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it sad enough to make you cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.01,0:17:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:17:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your response?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.13,0:18:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cracked the whole thing in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you\Nwant, but not that! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never said you were gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.35,0:18:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only supposed to\Nsilence the security
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.59,0:18:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guards to let you and the bad lads inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.13,0:18:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why is it now we're wrecking the\Nwhole sand steamer all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was never part of our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you misunderstanding something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won the goods on this ship, so why\Nthe hell would I have to answer to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I collect what's already mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.63,0:18:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, you ain't being beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna use your knowledge of\Nthe ship for a trade with the bad guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at least prepare for the worst,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.55,0:18:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you gotta leave the ship alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up and do what he says!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship belongs to my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.29,0:19:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship belongs to my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.19,0:19:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.07,0:19:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.19,0:19:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't fun anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Splatter time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay, Squirt? Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.37,0:19:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move now, or you'll get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, Samson was in the passenger cabin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.81,0:20:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, scumbags! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vest me a souvenir! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it something beautiful and gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, couldn't you think of\Na better way to rescue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks, big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so ungrateful, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I received a heck of\Na lot more damage than you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.51,0:21:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we climb a little higher, we\Ncan get to a ventilation shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, like, let's get going right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like trunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about hitting you like\NI did, Captain. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like I can't quite control\Nthe ship without your help after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this time, to make it\Neasier for you to steer,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I enlisted a volunteer from\Nthe passengers for inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit! You are sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.63,0:21:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go to hell and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.09,0:21:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting kind of tired\Nof being told to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.39,0:21:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking in the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The control lever is right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.85,0:21:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.01,0:21:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be the one\Nto break the bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.99,0:21:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least you'll be going down\Nwith it like a good captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.41,0:22:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only have one thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.15,0:24:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People who sin say this:\Nthat they had to to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.93,0:24:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,survive people who sin\Nsay this it's too late
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.69,0:24:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now to stop a shadow called sin dogs them
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.99,0:24:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,steadily from behind\Nsilently without a word
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.77,0:24:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remorse and agony are\Nrepeated only to end up at
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.59,0:24:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,despair in the end but the\Nsinners just don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.73,0:24:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that if they'd only turn\Naround there's a light there
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.61,0:24:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a light which keeps shining\Non them ever so lonely,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.73,0:24:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a light that will never fade.

